{
  "id": "28-slow-subscriber",
  "chapter": "Events",
  "title": "A slow subscriber",
  "brief": "Six posts arrive each second. Notifications must reach the followers fast: its Consumer Lag may be 5 s at most. Analytics only builds a report, so it may fall behind up to 30 s and catch up after the wave. Each Subscription has its own Workers and its own Backlog, so a slow Analytics never slows Notifications. One Worker instance takes 4 posts a second. Give each Subscription the Workers it needs, and no more.",
