        "medium"
      ],
      "maxInstances": 3
    }
  },
  "guidedHint": "Notifications falls behind: one Worker instance takes 4 posts a second, and 6 arrive. Add an instance to the Notifications Worker. Analytics may wait up to 30 s, so one instance is enough for it.",
